      "prov:value": "Read every instance declaration in the checkout and resolve what it names: `directories` (and those declared from within) through `check:declared-dirs`, `assets` through `check:declared-assets`, `visualisers[].renderedBy` through `check:visualiser-routes`, `needs` through the instance-graph resolver, and `visualisers[].coversKinds` against the graph typologies registered IN THIS CHECKOUT — its own and those a mounted layer contributes, read from the checkout under inspection rather than from where the harness module sits (lesson 6).",
